">\n          Video review\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Harpe II Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Mouse Media review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:none;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(6)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202402131957165300190.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"95%\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Gamepress.cz\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>95%</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG Azoth Extreme Edition 20 and Harpe II Extreme Edition 20 represent a pair of premium peripherals targeting gamers and enthusiasts looking for absolute quality and maximum possible collectible value. The Azoth Extreme keyboard offers top-tier dampening, perfectly tuned switches, and a luxurious construction, while the Harpe II Extreme scores with an extremely low weight, precise sensor, and instantaneous response.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>08/02/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Harpe II Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Mouse Media review Award of 95%\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://gamepress.cz/recenze-asus-rog-azoth-rog-harpe-ii-extreme-edition-20/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1250/202607131553423560030.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommended award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      PC Ekspert\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommended award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The sensor will be excellent for eSports champions, as well as for ordinary work in Windows, browsing, or anything else, and it works perfectly on a glass surface too.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CROATIA</span> <span>08/03/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Harpe II Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Mouse Media review Award of Recommended award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://pcekspert.com/clanak/asus-rog-harpe-ii-extreme-edition-20-recenzija/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/2004/202507141947157880381.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Ultimate hardware award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      SS MODS\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Ultimate hardware award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The build quality and everything that this ASUS ROG Harpe II Extreme Edition 20 offers hardware- and software-wise is at today's highest technological level.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>REPUBLIC OF SERBIA</span> <span>09/02/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Harpe II Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Mouse Media review Award of Ultimate hardware award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://ss-mods.com/asus-rog-harpe-ii-extreme-edition-20-najbolji-rog-mis/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/2004/202606231840264390262.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Editor's Choice - Outstanding product award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Svet Kompjutera\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Editor's Choice - Outstanding product award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      It is a demonstration of everything that Asus can currently offer in the world of gaming peripherals - from a top-tier sensor and 8K wireless connectivity, through premium materials, all the way to a collector's design with gold-plated details.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>REPUBLIC OF SERBIA</span> <span>07/16/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Harpe II Extreme Edition 20 Gaming Mouse Media review Award of Editor's Choice - Outstanding product award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.sk.rs/clanak/5622/asus-rog-harpe-ii-extreme-edition-20-sta-zamisljate-u-elitnom-misu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/2004/202606231840264390262.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Editor's choice - Outstanding product award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Svet Kompjutera\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Editor's choice - Outstanding product award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      It is a demonstration of everything Asus can currently offer in the world of gaming periphe